  "content": "<p>此模組為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a> 新增了功能，讓使用者能查看每個村民職業所需的工作方塊。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>使用方式：對著綠寶石或村民生怪蛋按下 JEI 的「用途」按鍵（預設為 U），即可顯示所有村民職業列表。若想查看某職業來自哪個模組，按住 Shift 鍵即可在職業名稱前方顯示模組 ID。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若您正在尋找 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>REI</strong></a> 的對應版本，請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-professions-rep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Professions (REP)</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz 合作夥伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼「mrbysco」首次月費可享 8 折優惠</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有任何疑問，歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord 連結\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; - Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; - ShyNieke</p>",
